CHAPTER.VERS:
But when Rebbe, Melech HaMoshiach came as the Kohen Gadol of the coming tovot
good things , he entered through the Mishkan Gadol, the greater and more perfect Mishkan, not made with hands, that is, not of this B'ri'ah
Creation ;

For Rebbe, Melech HaMoshiach did not enter into a Kodesh HaKodashim made by human hands, a mere tavnit 

          pattern, copy
         of the true Kodesh HaKodashim, but into Shomayim itself, now to appear before the face of Hashem for us;
